sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant GenAgent as 🔄 Generation Agent
    participant LangChain as 🤖 LangChain Orchestrator
    participant Executor as ⚙️ Test Executor
    participant Browser as 🌐 Playwright Browser
    participant SelfHeal as 🏥 Self-Healing Agent
    participant Storage as 💾 Storage

    User->>UI: 1. Fetch Jira Issue
    UI->>API: GET /jira/issues/GEN-27
    API-->>UI: Issue data + Description

    User->>UI: 2. Generate Test
    UI->>API: POST /generate-test
    activate GenAgent
    GenAgent->>GenAgent: English → Gherkin
    GenAgent->>GenAgent: Gherkin → Playwright Code
    GenAgent->>GenAgent: Validate TypeScript
    GenAgent-->>API: Generated test file
    deactivate GenAgent

    activate Storage
    Storage->>Storage: Save test code
    Storage-->>API: File saved
    deactivate Storage

    API-->>UI: Test code + File path

    User->>UI: 3. Execute Test
    UI->>API: POST /execute
    
    activate LangChain
    LangChain->>LangChain: Decision: Run test?
    LangChain->>LangChain: Check selector cache
    LangChain-->>Executor: Tool: run_test()

    activate Executor
    Executor->>Browser: npx playwright test
    Browser->>Browser: Launch browser
    Browser->>Browser: Navigate page
    Browser->>Browser: Fill credentials
    Browser->>Browser: Click login button
    Browser->>Browser: Assert CRM link visible
    alt Test PASSES ✅
        Browser-->>Executor: Exit code 0
        Executor-->>LangChain: {status: passed}
    else Test FAILS ❌
        Browser-->>Executor: Test failed - Selector not found
        Executor-->>LangChain: {status: failed, error}
        
        deactivate Executor
        
        LangChain->>LangChain: Decision: Heal test?
        LangChain-->>SelfHeal: Tool: heal_test()
        
        activate SelfHeal
        SelfHeal->>SelfHeal: 1️⃣ Detector: Parse error
        SelfHeal->>SelfHeal: 2️⃣ Analyzer: Root cause
        SelfHeal->>SelfHeal: 3️⃣ MCP: Query DOM
        SelfHeal->>SelfHeal: 4️⃣ Recommender: Find alternative
        SelfHeal->>SelfHeal: AI suggests: getByRole('link')
        SelfHeal-->>LangChain: {fixed: true, newSelector}
        
        activate Storage
        Storage->>Storage: Cache healed selector
        deactivate Storage
        
        deactivate SelfHeal
        
        LangChain->>Executor: Tool: run_test(withHeal)
        activate Executor
        Executor->>Browser: Retry with new selector
        Browser-->>Executor: Exit code 0 ✅
        deactivate Executor
    end

    Executor-->>LangChain: Final result
    deactivate LangChain

    LangChain-->>API: {status, passed, failed, healed}
    activate Storage
    Storage->>Storage: Save execution result
    deactivate Storage
    
    API-->>UI: Execution result
    UI->>UI: Display results
    User->>UI: View report
    UI-->>User: HTML Report 📊
